  "description": {
    "en": "A bold visual campaign for a new product line.\n\nYolo FIT expanded the brand into energy, movement and bold self-expression. I crafted a high-impact launch campaign across digital, print and street-level media that felt kinetic and immersive, true to the product's active lifestyle and to Yolo's playful DNA.\n\nBillboards with jagged patterns and vibrant color; branded lunch boxes for PR kits; launch stories ('Actívate, tú decides cómo'); marketing emails; street pole banners; hero key visuals with layered type; and responsive web and mobile banners.\n\nTimeframe: 10 days · Tools: Illustrator, Photoshop"
  },
